<title>AUSTRIA: Start of trade on Vienna bourse delayed.</title>
<headline>Start of trade on Vienna bourse delayed.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vienna bourse trade will start 50 minutes later than usual owing to technical problems, the stock exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
